    "1.07 - Time of Day\n",
    "We defined the following keyword patterns\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "*   Morning: morning, dawn, sunrise\n",
    "*   Evening: evening, night, midnight, late\n",
    "*   Dusk: dusk, sunset, twilight\n",
    "Otherwise: the time of day is set to unknown\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "aduznRt-Pnf-",
